PROGRAM collection authorization

TYPE CollectionMode is "counter" | "locker"

RECORD Proof is one of
  receipt:
    reference: text
  gift:
    message: text

RECORD Facts
  mode: CollectionMode
  staff_checked: boolean
  locker_checked: boolean
  proof: optional<Proof>

REQUEST authorize collection
  GIVEN facts is Facts
  WHEN LET reference be authorize facts
  OUTPUT reference is text

WHEN authorize <facts>
  GIVEN facts is Facts
  THEN returns text
  IF facts.mode == "counter"
    REQUIRE facts.staff_checked
    REQUIRE facts.proof is present
    REQUIRE facts.proof.kind == "receipt"
  ELSE
    REQUIRE true
    REQUIRE facts.proof is present
    REQUIRE facts.proof.kind == "receipt"
  REQUIRE facts.proof.reference != ""
  RETURN facts.proof.reference

SCENARIO checked counter returns the receipt reference
GIVEN facts is Facts
  mode: "counter"
  staff_checked: true
  locker_checked: false
  proof:
    kind: "receipt"
    reference: "R-1"
REQUEST authorize collection
THEN reference == "R-1"

SCENARIO checked locker returns the receipt reference
GIVEN facts is Facts
  mode: "locker"
  staff_checked: false
  locker_checked: true
  proof:
    kind: "receipt"
    reference: "R-2"
REQUEST authorize collection
THEN reference == "R-2"

SCENARIO checking the other mode does not authorize collection
GIVEN facts is Facts
  mode: <mode>
  staff_checked: <staff_checked>
  locker_checked: <locker_checked>
  proof:
    kind: "receipt"
    reference: "R-3"
REQUEST authorize collection
THEN fails with "assertion_failed"

EXAMPLES
  | mode      | staff_checked | locker_checked |
  | "counter" | false         | true           |
  | "locker"  | true          | false          |

SCENARIO a check cannot replace a receipt
GIVEN facts is Facts
  mode: "counter"
  staff_checked: true
  locker_checked: false
REQUEST authorize collection
THEN fails with "assertion_failed"

SCENARIO a gift message is not a receipt
GIVEN facts is Facts
  mode: "locker"
  staff_checked: false
  locker_checked: true
  proof:
    kind: "gift"
    message: "Enjoy"
REQUEST authorize collection
THEN fails with "assertion_failed"

SCENARIO an empty receipt reference cannot authorize collection
GIVEN facts is Facts
  mode: "counter"
  staff_checked: true
  locker_checked: false
  proof:
    kind: "receipt"
    reference: ""
REQUEST authorize collection
THEN fails with "assertion_failed"
